Created demo Table: demo_3groups

Three-group comparison (Soprano / Mezzo / Alto).
  Data column: SPL_dB or vibrato_rate_Hz
  Group column: voice_type
  Note: both measures decline across the three
        voice types — SPL_dB at 92 / 88 / 85 dB,
        vibrato_rate_Hz at 5.8 / 5.5 / 5.2 Hz.
        The SPL gap is the larger of the two.
  Try: Stats Wizard → Compare groups or conditions
       → No — different groups (independent)
       → Three or more groups
  Or go straight there: New → EML Stats & Graphs →
       Compare k groups (ANOVA)... or
       Compare k groups (Kruskal-Wallis)...

Seed: 2067519806 — the same seed rebuilds this table.

Select the Table and use the EML Stats & Graphs menu or Wizard.
